        "nobel_worthiness": "SASE X-ray free-electron lasers created a transformative coherent, ultrafast X-ray source and an enduring new experimental capability.",
        "attribution": "Pellegrini, Rossbach and Ishikawa represent decisive conceptual, accelerator-development and operational realization contributions.",
        "maturity": "The method has been repeatedly demonstrated at major facilities and supports a broad, mature scientific community.",
        "uncertainties": [
