        "attribution": "Della Negra, Jenni and Virdee are representative leaders of the detector collaborations, but no small set can fully capture the achievement.",
        "maturity": "The discovery is definitive and has been followed by extensive measurements of Higgs properties.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The 2013 prize for the Higgs mechanism and the scale of the experimental collaborations complicate a separate award."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "rank": 8,
      "ballot_id": "B014",
      "proposed_laureates": [
        "Michael V. Berry",
        "Yakir Aharonov"
